  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Forge ahead in timeless style! No matter where your day takes you, the ASICS GEL-DS Trainer 14 supports your every move. Inspired by the key design elements of archived running shoes from the late ‘00s, these sneakers boast an asymmetric upper construction and mesh paneling to create a bold, standout aesthetic. The Rearfoot GEL technology absorbs impact and cushions every step. Whether you’re running errands, strolling around town, or meeting friends, the ASICS GEL-DS Trainer 14 lets you do it all in style.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-DS Trainer 14 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Mesh upper offers breathability.</li> <li>Asymmetric upper construction reflects the design language of technical running shoes in the late 2000s to add a classic look.</li> <li>Tooling shape with sleeker construction and comfortable cushioning properties provides a relaxed feel.</li> <li>TRUSSTIC unit maximizes support.</li> <li>Foam and GEL midsole delivers superior comfort.</li> <li>Rubber outsole ensures traction.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-DS Trainer 14 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>White/Port Royal</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper wi